# Midwest AEC private keys.
# This file stays on your computer. It is excluded from git, so it never goes to GitHub.
# Never paste these values into a chat or a script.
# Format: NAME=value   (no spaces, no quotes). Save the file after you edit it.

# ---------- Used now ----------
# Bing Webmaster Tools: Settings > API access > generate a NEW key, then paste it after the =
BING_API_KEY=

